<mxCell id="c10" value='- CloudTrail log file integrity validation on&lt;br&gt;- Lifecycle: 90 days Standard, then&lt;br&gt;  Glacier Instant Retrieval, then Deep Archive&lt;br&gt;- Bucket policy denies DeleteObject and&lt;br&gt;  PutLifecycleConfiguration to everyone but&lt;br&gt;  one break-glass role&lt;br&gt;- Queried in place with Athena; nobody&lt;br&gt;  copies logs out "for analysis"' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="430" width="390" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
